  "question": {
    "text": "Two light beams of intensities in the ratio of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;are allowed to interfere. The ratio of the intensity of maxima and minima will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>81</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>169</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Data provided in the question is, the ratio of the intensities,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math></p><p>After taking square root of above equation on both sides, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Apply componendo and dividendo,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}